SUMMARY:MAGLabs @ Peabody Heights
DESCRIPTION:MAGLabs is returning to Peabody Heights Brewery in Baltimore\, MD on September 12 (note this is wrong on the form). They have a limited amount of space for indies. The deadline to apply is this Friday 8/7 (also different from the form). \nMAGLabs Indie Game Application
URL:https://baltimoreindiegames.com/event/maglabs-peabody-heights/
LOCATION:Peabody Heights Brewery\, 401 E 30th St\, Baltimore\, MD\, 21218\, United States
