SUMMARY:IGDA Baltimore Game Escape 2026 Indie Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Game Escape is an all-ages public showcase of independent games created by developers in and around Maryland! Last year we had over 250 people come out to play locally made indie games\, and we’re excited to return to the SNF Parkway this year for another chance to show off new and improved games from local devs. Parking is available in limited quantities on the street\, and the recommended parking lot is 1714 N Charles St. \n \nGame Escape 2025 \nPresented by: IGDA Baltimore | with support from: MAGFest!
URL:https://baltimoreindiegames.com/event/game-escape-2026-indie-showcase/
LOCATION:Parkway Theatre\, 5 W North Ave\, Baltimore\, MD\, 21201\, United States
END:VEVENT
