SUMMARY:Game Your Future Conference 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Game Your Future Conference is where the gaming industry comes together with technology\, education\, entrepreneurship\, and workforce development to explore what’s next. Over three immersive days\, developers\, creators\, students\, educators\, business leaders\, and innovators connect through hands-on workshops\, expert panels\, networking events\, interactive exhibits\, and live competitions that demonstrate how gaming is transforming careers\, industries\, and communities. \nWhether you’re building your first game\, growing a studio\, preparing students for careers in interactive media\, exploring emerging technologies like AI and cybersecurity\, or looking to connect with the next generation of talent\, Game Your Future offers opportunities to learn directly from industry professionals while building relationships that continue long after the conference ends. \nGeneral admission is $90 (55% off) through the end of August.  \nStudent tickets are $25 with ID. \nTickets: https://www.game4good.gg/game-your-future-conference-2026/
URL:https://baltimoreindiegames.com/event/game-your-future-conference-2026/
LOCATION:Baltimore Convention Center\, 1 W Pratt Street\, Baltimore\, MD\, 21201\, United States
END:VEVENT
