SUMMARY:IGDA DC District Arcade
DESCRIPTION:District Arcade is a free celebration of games and game makers from the DC and DMV area. Play locally-crafted indie games and chat with the devs in this fun\, family-friendly in person event. \nWe want you to showcase your game! Apply by September 24: \nhttps://forms.gle/1D6HUiPa45Dq1XGb6
URL:https://baltimoreindiegames.com/event/igda-dc-district-arcade/
LOCATION:MD
END:VEVENT
