SUMMARY:Super MAGFest
DESCRIPTION:Super MAGFest (short for “Music And Gaming Festival”) is a four day-long event dedicated to the appreciation of video game music\, gaming of all types\, and the gaming community. The event runs 24 hours a day\, and offers consoles\, arcades\, tabletop\, LAN\, live video game cover bands\, chiptunes\, vendors\, guest speakers\, and so much more. \nIf you’re an indie dev who wants to show a game at MAGFest’s Indie Videogame Showcase\, submissions are open until July 31\, 2026: \nhttps://super2027.reg.magfest.org/showcase/apply \n 
URL:https://baltimoreindiegames.com/event/super-magfest-2/
LOCATION:Gaylord National Resort & Convention Center\, 201 Waterfront St\, Oxon Hill\, MD\, 20745\, United States
END:VEVENT
